WEBVTT

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.370
You girls play hardball, do you?

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.790
Um... yes...

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.250
What school are you from?

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.370
Satogahama High.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.460
Do you play baseball, too?

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.760
Oh, is that so?

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.900
Well, bye.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.180
Answer my question, would you?!

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.270
What was that about?

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.170
No idea.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.140
She was very cute.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.100
I'm sure I've seen her somewhere before...

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.940
<b>Girls' Baseball 
National Tournament Guide</b>

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.220
"Girls' Baseball...

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.910
...National Tournament Guide"?

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.110
A lot of effort went into it.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:05.870
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:04.070
You'll find meet-up locations and
the tournament schedule in there,

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:05.870
so make sure you read every page.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.750
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.860
It feels like we're planning a class trip.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:08.880
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:12.340
Having everything in
one place is a big help, though.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.340
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:15.820
You look happy.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.300
N-Not really.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.760
I have one more thing to tell you.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.970
What is it?

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.380
Yesterday, another school asked
if we wanted a practice game.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.760
You'd be playing Kogetsu High School.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.690
Wait... Kogetsu?

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<b>National High School Girls' Invitational Baseball Tournament          Round 1: Kogetsu High vs. Nakafuji High</b>

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.650
Isn't that the really good school we saw
in that video from last year's nationals?

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.740
<b>National High School Girls' Invitational Baseball Tournament          Round 1: Kogetsu High vs. Nakafuji High</b>

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.650
<b>National High School Girls' Invitational Baseball Tournament          Round 1: Kogetsu High vs. Nakafuji High</b>

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.910
Why does such a strong team want to play us?

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:41.860
A girl on their team saw you practicing

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:45.330
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:43.980
while they were on a training camp nearby,

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.330
and she insisted.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:47.300
Now I remember!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.790
That girl we saw earlier was Kogetsu's ace,

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.000
Kosaka Tsubaki!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.460
<b>National High School Girls' Invitational Baseball Tournament          Round 1: Kogetsu High vs. Nakafuji High</b>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:54.700
The number one pitcher in Japan?

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.300
What do you say?

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.420
We'll do it!

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.050
We're grateful for the chance to
play a game before the tournament!

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:14.320
Okay, then. Let's all do our best!

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.140
Let's do this!

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.770
Yeah!

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:24.740
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.860
Tsubasa. Shinonome-san. 
Do you have a moment?

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.740
Huh? Sure.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.070
What is it?

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:40.050
It's your decision, Captain.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:44.970
We won't win if we just go out to have fun.
I haven't forgotten our game against Seijo.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.170
Yeah.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.990
<b>Wings on Your Back</b>

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.290
Everyone, gather 'round!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:42.760
I'm going to announce who'll be
starting in the upcoming tournament.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.720
It's not the same as last time?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:50.180
Since we have some new members in our ranks,
I came up with a regular roster.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:54.810
I'll get Kakehashi-sensei to hand out your 
number decals for the tournament later.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.150
Okay, our pitcher will be Kurashiki Maiko.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:00.360
Me?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.440
Our catcher is Suzuki Waka.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.070
Right.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.470
On first, Nozaki Yuuki.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.570
R-Right!

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:09.550
On second, Asada Aoi.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.230
Second?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.250
On third, Shinonome Ryou.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.300
Right.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.080
I, Arihara Tsubasa, will play shortstop.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.430
In left field, Iwaki Yoshimi.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:20.290
Okay!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.720
In center field, Nakano Ayaka.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.010
Gotcha.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.720
In right field, Tsukumo Kana.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:29.170
Okay.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.650
This will be our regular roster.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.510
Then... we'll do our best to support you all.

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.320
We'll be rooting for everyone.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:46.780
That's important too, but I need 
you two to be our base coaches.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.740
Base... coaches?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:54.370
We all took turns doing it in
the practice game with Seijo,

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.710
but it's better to have it
assigned permanently.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:05:59.820
Okay!

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:00.790
We've got this!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.070
I'm counting on you!

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:10.300
This means "steal,"
and this means "squeeze."

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.680
What about this?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.730
Uh...

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.140
Oh! "Bunt"!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.440
Right!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:33.660
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.760
There are first-base coaches 
and third-base coaches,

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:23.170
but since it's a practice game,
why don't we rotate?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:23.890
Okay!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.390
Well, guess we should head home.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:38.960
Hey...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.550
How did you... really... feel about this?

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.630
Well, I had been practicing on my own,

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.780
so, I mean... you know...

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.270
Me too...

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.640
But... Tsukumo-senpai is really good.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.600
I agree with the decision, too.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.150
Let's both do our best!

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:03.890
Yeah!

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.790
Are you all right?

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.500
Yuuki-chan? Wh-What do you mean?

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.290
We understand, you know.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.420
What we need to do now...

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:40.130
is work together as a team
to prepare for our next game.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.220
Thanks.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.590
<b>Kogetsu High School Girls' Baseball Club</b>

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.590
<b>Data</b>

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.590
<b>Top Secret</b>

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.250
Sorry for keeping you waiting!

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.030
Let me introduce myself.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:33.110
I'm Kosaka Tsubaki of the Kogetsu 
High School girls' baseball club.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:36.780
I'm Arihara Tsubasa of the Satogahama 
High School girls' baseball club.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.510
Thank you for playing us today.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:41.790
Feeling's mutual.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.350
I appreciate you giving 
our third string a game.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:46.750
Third string?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.290
I'm only here as their leader.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.440
Looks like you don't have anyone to spare,

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.720
so we'll provide the umpires.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.550
She's totally looking down on us!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.050
Arihara-san...

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.740
Right!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.020
Let's get this started!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.650
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.650
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.650
<b>Team</b>

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.850
Play ball!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.340
<i>Being the starting pitcher...</i>

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.040
<i>It's a huge responsibility.</i>

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:27.650
Out!

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.080
Nice catch!

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.140
Out!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.350
Nice play, Tsukumo-senpai!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:57.900
<i>She's stealing?</i>

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:02.500
Don't worry about it!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.120
Nice steal!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.140
Good job!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.170
<i>Not good enough!</i>

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.830
Go! Go! You can make it!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.260
Nice batting!

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:24.550
Senpai...

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.190
That woke me up.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.820
<b>Kogetsu High School Girls' Baseball Club</b>

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.820
<b>Data</b>

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.820
<b>Top Secret</b>

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.820
This is the data I gathered on
Kogetsu High during their training camp.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:43.780
2 Weeks Till Nationals

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:42.150
I didn't have a lot of time,
but I did get to see all of their pitchers.

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:43.780
Nakano-san...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.940
We need to do whatever we can, right?

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:49.000
I don't want to be left
with regrets like last time.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.960
We don't want to lose, right?

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.430
Right.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.530
Three outs!

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:11.980
Seriously? Just the one run?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.440
<b>Team</b>

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.440
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.440
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.890
Okay, let's get that one back!

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:27.790
I'll show 'em!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.630
Nice batting!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.850
<i>What? She's leading off that much?</i>

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>Payback time!</i>

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.440
Nice running!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.690
<i>Was there a steal sign out?</i>

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.430
That pitcher isn't good at pickoffs.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.730
Nakano-san's data came in handy.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.370
No outs, runner on second...

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.330
<i>Okay, gotcha!</i>

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.370
<i>Um... That one is...</i>

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.130
Out!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.840
Nice bunt!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.260
How could you not see that bunt coming?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.300
Do you even practice?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.100
It's up to you, Tsubasa!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.060
Leave it to me!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.230
Strike!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.940
You can't pitch like that to her.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.850
A home run?

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:58.900
Yes!

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:00.630
A home run!

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.630
All right!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.130
See what I mean?

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.400
Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.820
Nice coaching!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.930
Kawakita-san...

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.300
She's amazing...

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.550
So close!

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.010
<b>Team</b>

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.010
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.010
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.640
<b>Team</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.640
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.640
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.360
<b>Team</b>

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.360
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.360
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.930
We're leading 3-1. It's looking good.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.320
Yeah!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.250
<i>Our last practice game 
wasn't a waste after all.</i>

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.850
<i>One day, I'll...</i>

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.380
Tsubasa! Give us another one!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:34.300
A-Arihara-san!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.060
Out!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.280
Whoopsie...

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.230
Switch left fielders!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:54.230
Wait, please! I won't mess up next time!

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:58.370
Kogetsu doesn't need players who stink.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.940
That goes for all of you!

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:05.860
Keep up this pathetic play,
and you're getting hauled off!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.540
What's her problem?

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:23.020
<i>Arihara-san's out earlier... 
was my fault, wasn't it?</i>

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:28.490
<i>I'm... of no use to them at all, am I?</i>

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.830
<i>It's more like...</i>

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.990
<i>I'm just... here.</i>

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.370
Strike three!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.270
Akane-chan!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.760
<b>Team</b>

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.760
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.760
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.950
I'm... sorry...

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.140
<b>Team</b>

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.140
<b>Kogetsu</b>

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.140
<b>Satogahama</b>

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.540
<i>She's been pitching all-out so far.</i>

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.730
<i>She must be getting tired.</i>

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.180
<i>That's Kogetsu for you.</i>

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:32.830
<i>Even their third string
won't go down without a fight.</i>

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.870
Out!

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.210
<i>I know.</i>

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:57.820
This is where we need to dig in!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:59.700
Yeah!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.840
Nice try!

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:11.800
I can do better!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.540
You hung in there a long time.

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:19.540
Senpai...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:22.560
We're putting up a good fight, though.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.820
Heck, we might... We just might...

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.260
Yes, we still have a chance.

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.990
We'll swap bases in the next inning.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:35.670
I can't do it.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.950
Third base is more
closely tied with scoring.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.490
It's so much responsibility.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:45.800
I'd rather someone else
took over for the first-base coach, too.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.180
Ukita-san?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.700
I'll just sit here and watch.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:58.060
That was all I planned to do when 
I joined the association, anyway.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.180
What about now?

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.010
Are you okay with just watching?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.930
But we're so close to winning this time...

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:12.870
When we first started the association,

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.580
your determination kept 
me going, Akane-chan.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.950
You're Nozaki-san from my class, right?

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.430
And Ukita-san, too.

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:23.690
You know her?

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.200
She's in my class.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.500
Makes sense.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.460
Are you interested in baseball?

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.390
Huh?

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.220
I-I-I am!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.390
Finding out there were other girls
like us at Sato High made me so happy.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.260
So I don't want you to give up now.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:43.980
Let's fight through this together,

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:45.900
and win!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.470
I want to win too... but...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.050
I'm scared.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.010
So...

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.070
Please help me!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:04.100
Did that perk you up?

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:05.730
Uh-huh!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.870
Ready to go?

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:10.890
Yeah!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.810
I'm as pumped as I can be, too!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.280
Tsubasa, go!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:40.850
Safe!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.720
Tsukumo-senpai... We're counting on you.

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:16.110
Safe!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.110
Go!

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:31.700
Safe!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.130
Nice coaching!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.530
We're changing pitchers.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.870
Here she comes.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:49.510
This'll be interesting.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.970
Strike! You're out!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.860
Go for it!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:20.890
And that's game!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.850
We did it!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.900
